OL,4,BDe Boinville given extra security at   
OL,5,BPlumpton after threat                  
OL,6,GJockey Nico de Boinville had to be     
OL,7,Ggiven extra security support at        
OL,8,GPlumpton racecourse after being the    
OL,9,Gsubject of a threat.                   
OL,11,FDe Boinville finished fifth aboard the 
OL,12,FNicky Henderson-trained Ginolo in the  
OL,13,Ffirst race on Monday at the East       
OL,14,FSussex track.                          
OL,16,FThe 37-year-old was then told he would 
OL,17,Frequire additional security after      
OL,18,Fofficials were made aware of a threat  
OL,19,Fto the Henderson yard.                 
